This study examines the semileptonic decay of doubly charmed baryons using the bag model. We calculate the form factors for the transitions $\Xi_{cc}^{++} 	o \Xi_{c}^{+} \ell^{+} 
u_{\ell}$ and $\Xi_{cc}^{++} 	o \Omega_{c}^{0} \ell^{+} 
u_{\ell}$, where $\ell$ represents an electron or muon. The results indicate that the form factors for the $\Xi_{cc}^{++} 	o \Xi_{c}^{+} \ell^{+} 
u_{\ell}$ process are significantly larger than those for the $\Xi_{cc}^{++} 	o \Omega_{c}^{0} \ell^{+} 
u_{\ell}$ process.
